cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Renvoy in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Renvoy: one CI/CD definition, native pipelines for every provider"
abstract: >-
  Renvoy compiles one provider-neutral CI/CD definition (renvoy.yaml) into
  native pipeline files for GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Azure DevOps Pipelines,
  Jenkins Declarative Pipeline, and Atlassian Bamboo (YAML and Java Specs). Each
  provider declares a capability matrix, so anything a provider cannot express
  is reported as a located error instead of being dropped, and generated files
  carry checksums so hand edits are never silently overwritten.
type: software
authors:
